# anim-spring: animation (frame MS shows the screen for MS ms).
eval 0 40 10 48 UI-SURFACE\n1 0 160 120 40 10 UI-VISIBLE UI-DECOR OR UI-SHADOW OR UI-WINDOW\nS" Notes" 1 UI-TITLE\nS" Hello from the CPU" 0 1 1 48 UI-TYPE\n0 0 3 40 1 2 48 UI-FILL\n0 19 1 3 TRUE UI-CARET\n1 UI-FOCUS  UI-COMMIT
place 1 160 40
eval 1 UI-CLOSE
eval 1 0 160 480 40 10 7 UI-WINDOW S" Notes" 1 UI-TITLE 1 UI-FOCUS UI-COMMIT
eval UI-TWEEN-WINDOW 1 UI-Y 480 80 900 UI-SPRING UI-ANIMATE
frame 80
idle 1
